  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have improved draconic defenses, and wings that allow you to truly glide.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Draconic Glide<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a + 4 bonus on saving throws against sleep and paralysis effects. Your wings allow you to glide 5 feet in any horizontal direction for every 1 foot you fall, at a speed of 30 feet per round, with a DC 15 Fly check.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you have the gliding wings racial trait your base speed increases to 120 feet. By spending one use of your mythic power, you can gain true flight with a speed of 60 feet for up to 1 minute per mythic tier you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc109\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
